[TestRequireLinkSignal/invalid-5 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: noLinkSignalInPrivate (9:82 - 9:109)
Message: A private method already gets a linked signal from the public method that calls it.
Help: Pass the signal through as-is instead of calling `super.linkSignal` again.
   8 | class A extends Base {
   9 |   private run({ signal }: { signal: AbortSignal }) { return fetch("x", { signal: super.linkSignal({ signal }) }); }
     |                                                                                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  10 | }
